  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brazil, China. Connect is a development project facilitating for mutual exchange of youth between three organizations: NMS (Det Norske Misjonsselskap), Movimento Encontr&#xe3;o and ELCHK (The Evangelical Lutheran Church of Hong Kong). Connect is focusing on youth involvement and youth leadership, and to increase the focus on global challenges, like poverty and environmental issues, and that we all are part of a global world. The hope is that the project will contribute to create young leaders in Hong Kong, Brazil and Norway that are influencing and being involved in their local communities to make a positive change.</narrative>
  </description>
